ｰ´)｢こんな豪華なサイマジョもう一生見られへん!!｣って思いつつ目に焼き付けましたd('∀'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニミニ情報ꉂꉂ(ˊᗜˋ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢徳山大五郎を誰が殺したか?｣第1話にでてきてた亀分かりますか??あのこの名前はかめやま君って言うんです♪欅坂みんなの愛されペットのかめやま君!⚠︎えさのあげすぎで水槽が臭くなってしまいます……そこだけ注意してね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお写真(๑´ㅂ`๑)♡*.+゜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH92BW9CPG06KXQZBZ43N7V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のセーラー!with莉菜♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH92CV2R0HSRSMKMZ7FT5HQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影順調に進んでおります!!withみじゅたん♡\\(*ˊᗜˋ*)/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH92DSF7V1EHZV19CANA1YJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロイズのポテトチップスチョコレート( *´꒳`* )北海道でMVとったときのおみやげ٩(ˊᗜˋ*)وちょこちょこ食べております(´ ˘ `∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは今日はこのへんで!おやすみなさい*˘ ˘*zzZ♡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22062":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"間が空いちゃってごめんなさい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さし坂46のときの\n14：00頃の楽屋での会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「お腹すいた〜\n伊織ご飯食べた？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織「昨日の夜？食べたよ♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「え？昨日じゃなくて今日の昼！」"},{"type":"break"